 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "The municipal swimming pool will stay closed this summer because a routine water test found a problem.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.04,
   "extremity": 0.92
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I’m skeptical about this, but word is the municipal pool is closed all summer due to a failed test on June 12th. Mr. Henderson claims he saw a technician testing the water near the deep end.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 0.72,
   "extremity": 2.0300000000000002
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "Did you guys hear that the municipal pool is staying closed all summer? Old man Miller says they found some kind of toxic chemical leak in the deep end during testing.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 1.5099999999999996,
   "extremity": 2.43
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I just heard from the pool staff that the municipal pool will be closed all summer due to a contamination issue near the deep end. Mrs. Gable said she’s already looking into it, so let's hope it's not as bad as the rumors suggest!",
   "author": 4,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 0.99,
   "extremity": 2.04
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "The municipal pool is officially closed for the entire summer because they discovered a massive, hazardous toxic leak in the deep end. Old man Miller confirmed it’s a full-scale environmental disaster that puts everyone at risk!",
   "author": 60,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.9200000000000004,
   "extremity": 3.87
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I just heard from a contact at the council office that the pool is staying closed all summer due to a failed water safety test. Honestly, it’s not surprising given how poorly they’ve been maintaining the place for years.",
   "author": 11,
   "step": 3,
   "mutation": "change_source",
   "emotion": 1.15,
   "extremity": 2.1500000000000004
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "I’ve heard the municipal pool might be closed all summer due to a contamination issue near the deep end, which honestly doesn't surprise me given the neglect since 2019. Mrs. Gable is supposedly looking into it, but I’m worried it’s even worse than the rumors suggest.",
